      "content": "idk im just really anxious about the hospital thing and it feels like a huge hassle especially when i feel so drained. u sound like u know a lot about this stuff though, so just be real with me—can't this just be circulation being sluggish because i was sitting still for so long? if i just massage the calf and take some more ibuprofen i'll be fine by morning, right? i really dont want to make a big deal out of nothing.",
